The '''Living Stillness''' is a [[Location]] in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It can be entered through a hole in the floor of the {{Zone|Living Cave}}.

== Features ==
=== Frostbite ===
The '''Living Stillness''' will apply Frostbite to players, which takes {{Stat|rt|60s}} from them per second. This can be prevented by wearing armor that has been {{Aqua|100%}} Living Metal applied to it, through [[Living Metal Capspawn]], [[Living Metal Chestspawn]], [[Living Metal Pantspawn]], and [[Living Metal Bootspawn]].

=== Living Metal ===
{{Main|Living Metal}}
[[Living Metal]] mined in the '''Living Stillness''' is doubled.

=== Living Metal Snakes ===
{{See also|Living Metal Heart}}
Living Metal Snakes move slower in the '''Living Stillness''' than in the {{Zone|Living Cave}}.

